### &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;🚀 Features

- Add streamable http mcp server &nbsp;-&nbsp; by @ourongxing [<samp>(b7843)</samp>](https://github.com/ourongxing/newsnow/commit/b784389)

**Only supports Docker or local deployment, due to Nitro's bug**
```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "newsnow": {
      "url": "http://localhost:4444/api/mcp",
    }
  }
}
```

