### &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;🚀 Features

- Add offical mcp server closed #156 &nbsp;-&nbsp; by @ourongxing in https://github.com/ourongxing/newsnow/issues/156 [<samp>(e6d6c)</samp>](https://github.com/ourongxing/newsnow/commit/e6d6c61)

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "newsnow": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "newsnow-mcp-server"
      ],
      "env": {
        "BASE_URL": "https://newsnow.busiyi.world"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

You can change the BASE_URL to your own domain.

